<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<p>We collect essential contact information (email address, account username), payment transaction receipts uploaded for verification, and technical logs (IP addresses for SSH session auditing and system telemetry) required to securely provide our services.</p>
<h2>Data Security &amp; Encryption</h2>
<p>All user secrets, API credentials, and SSH private keys are stored using industry-standard AES-256-GCM encryption. We do not sell or monetize personal customer information to third-party data aggregators.</p>
<h2>Third-Party Integrations</h2>
<p>When enabled, deployment webhooks interact with GitHub and GitLab. Network ingress and reverse proxying are managed via internal Traefik and edge Anycast nodes.</p>
